WEBVTT

00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:36.583
"17 Years Later"

00:00:36.583 --> 00:00:38.083
"The Setting"

00:00:38.083 --> 00:00:40.042
"Tokyo"

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.292
Who's there?

00:02:33.167 --> 00:02:36.000
"Police Investigation"

00:02:42.708 --> 00:02:44.875
At the moment, no detailed
information has been announced.

00:02:44.875 --> 00:02:48.167
Beyond the fact that it was
a student from a Tokyo school...

00:03:03.792 --> 00:03:05.250
"Tokyo Majin Gakuen Kenpuucho"

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:08.083
"Tou"
"Tokyo Majin Gakuen Kenpuucho"

00:03:09.625 --> 00:03:11.000
"Dark Arts Chapter"

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.083
"Dark Arts Chapter"
"First Night"

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:14.083
"Moment of the Demonic Encounter"

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.625
Just like you wanted, Boss.

00:03:17.625 --> 00:03:21.042
Here's one exactly as it was found,
no autopsy done on it yet.

00:03:21.042 --> 00:03:22.250
It's too damn smoky in here.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:24.833
What are you talking about? You're smoking too!

00:03:24.833 --> 00:03:27.292
And anyway, why don't you help me move her?

00:03:27.292 --> 00:03:28.250
Forget it.

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:32.333
Sheesh, nice attitude for
a guy who wants a favor!

00:03:32.333 --> 00:03:34.292
Just shut up and do your job.

00:03:34.292 --> 00:03:35.958
Yeah, yeah...

00:03:39.042 --> 00:03:40.958
This makes five now.

00:03:40.958 --> 00:03:43.667
That we were able to find, at least.

00:03:43.667 --> 00:03:48.000
Anyhow, every last drop of
water's been sucked from her body.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.667
--Desiccated?
--That's right.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.292
Kind of a shame though.

00:03:54.292 --> 00:03:57.208
I mean, she was just a high schooler, y'know?

00:03:57.208 --> 00:03:58.750
Damn waste...

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.375
Shut up and get to work.

00:04:00.375 --> 00:04:02.083
Yeah, yeah...

00:04:10.708 --> 00:04:12.042
What is it?

00:04:12.042 --> 00:04:13.875
She's all yours.

00:04:13.875 --> 00:04:16.542
Whoa! What the heck?!

00:04:19.167 --> 00:04:20.625
"Magami Academy"

00:04:32.958 --> 00:04:36.333
Hey, what's the matter? You won't eat it?

00:04:42.542 --> 00:04:44.792
They're Tokushima carrots.

00:04:44.792 --> 00:04:47.292
He, his, him...

00:04:47.292 --> 00:04:49.375
You, your, you...

00:04:49.375 --> 00:04:52.542
It's, like, all about <i>you</i>!

00:04:52.542 --> 00:04:56.875
Putting that aside for now, in <i>this </i>instance...

00:04:56.875 --> 00:05:00.375
So anyhow, as it depends on
the following indirect object...

00:05:00.375 --> 00:05:02.083
And... You!

00:05:08.417 --> 00:05:11.542
That makes it 10-2, <i>me</i>! Woohoo!

00:05:11.542 --> 00:05:13.583
Hey!

00:05:13.583 --> 00:05:18.458
Get the hell out here!

00:05:18.458 --> 00:05:22.458
Let's settle this shit once and for all!

00:05:22.458 --> 00:05:25.417
Aren't those the Four Great Ones from Sumida?

00:05:25.417 --> 00:05:27.500
Those guys never learn.

00:05:29.292 --> 00:05:30.792
Kyouichi?

00:05:32.458 --> 00:05:34.792
How about some coffee milk?

00:05:34.792 --> 00:05:36.625
Strawberry milk.

00:05:36.625 --> 00:05:40.625
Hey! Yeah, you, the delinquent
and narcoleptic transfer student...

00:05:40.625 --> 00:05:41.667
Maria, honey...

00:05:41.667 --> 00:05:42.542
--I got a fever so I'm heading home early today.

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:45.125
--Stomachache for me.
--I got a fever so I'm heading home early today.

00:05:45.125 --> 00:05:47.583
Listen, you two...

00:05:47.583 --> 00:05:49.375
Hey, stop!

00:05:49.375 --> 00:05:50.542
Later!

00:05:55.958 --> 00:05:58.625
I'm already running low on sleep,
plus I was bored as hell just then.

00:05:58.625 --> 00:06:00.292
I'll take you guys on.

00:06:01.417 --> 00:06:03.208
How could you?!

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:40.958
Go for it guys! C'mon, Kyouichi!

00:06:40.958 --> 00:06:43.333
Jeez...

00:06:43.333 --> 00:06:44.833
Those idiots!

00:06:44.833 --> 00:06:46.458
Komaki?

00:07:06.833 --> 00:07:08.792
As I thought...

00:07:08.792 --> 00:07:13.750
It's too weak a link. I can only
assume I'm overlooking some element.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:17.958
More than twenty in two months...

00:07:17.958 --> 00:07:20.792
The other gangs can't figure it out either.

00:07:20.792 --> 00:07:24.833
Well, it couldn't possibly
be normal people doin' this.

00:07:24.833 --> 00:07:28.167
It's not exactly certain they <i>are </i>people.

00:07:28.167 --> 00:07:31.083
We oughta check with the boss on this one.

00:07:31.083 --> 00:07:32.375
Huh?

00:07:32.375 --> 00:07:37.292
You guys ever heard of the "living dead"?

00:07:37.292 --> 00:07:38.458
All of them?

00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:40.250
You gotta be kidding me!

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:43.583
I hadn't even finished my autopsy report on
our newest addition, before she up and runs off!

00:07:43.583 --> 00:07:46.167
That's downright dirty!

00:07:46.167 --> 00:07:49.750
Boss, don't tell me you saw this coming!

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:51.917
Shut up and do your job.

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:55.917
My job?

00:07:57.083 --> 00:08:00.750
I'm gonna use this to send you to the other side!

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:03.958
C'mon now, show me what
ya got! Gimme your worst!

00:08:03.958 --> 00:08:06.250
Guess I got no choice...

00:08:15.458 --> 00:08:24.458
Houraiji, you're always
making an ass of me like that.

00:08:24.458 --> 00:08:26.000
I'll kill...

00:08:27.875 --> 00:08:30.542
Ouch! Ouch! Hey, let's talk this over!

00:08:30.542 --> 00:08:35.417
It hurts! It hurts! C'mon, cut it out!

00:08:38.292 --> 00:08:39.750
What the <i>heck </i>are you doing?!

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:41.625
Is that an earth evasion technique?

00:08:41.625 --> 00:08:44.000
I was lying in wait of a scoop!

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:46.958
Well, you've certainly got enthusiasm.

00:08:46.958 --> 00:08:49.375
The mysterious transfer student, Tatsuma Hiyuu,

00:08:49.375 --> 00:08:51.708
hooks up with the delinquent, Kyouichi Houraiji.

00:08:51.708 --> 00:08:54.000
Cuts class, gets into brawls
both on and off campus,

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:57.417
buys junk food to eat on the way home
and so forth over the last two months,

00:08:57.417 --> 00:08:59.042
for a total of 26 offenses.

00:08:59.042 --> 00:09:01.667
That puts you at fifth on
Magami High's all-time list.

00:09:01.667 --> 00:09:04.125
Mysterious? So I'm a mystery, huh?

00:09:04.125 --> 00:09:06.000
Anko!

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:08.333
Jeez, you sure are one persistent woman!

00:09:08.333 --> 00:09:10.500
I dunno if you'd call it journalism or what,

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:14.458
but what you're doing is plain
old spying, ya friggin' stalker!

00:09:14.458 --> 00:09:15.625
You're like those pa... pa...

00:09:15.625 --> 00:09:17.667
--Paparazzi?
--Yeah, that's it!

00:09:17.667 --> 00:09:18.833
Ya friggin' parapazzi!

00:09:18.833 --> 00:09:20.333
Paparazzi...

00:09:20.333 --> 00:09:22.667
Being a paparazzi is <i>perfectly </i>fine with me!

00:09:22.667 --> 00:09:26.000
So more importantly, what have
<i>you </i>guys been up to every night, huh?

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:29.250
You and the student council president, Aoi Misato,

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.875
the captain of the archery team, Komaki Sakurai,

00:09:31.875 --> 00:09:35.125
and the captain of the
wrestling team, Yuuya Daigo...

00:09:35.125 --> 00:09:37.500
Kind of an odd combination, wouldn't you say?

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:40.875
You aren't particularly close at school either.

00:09:40.875 --> 00:09:42.167
Something smells fishy!

00:09:42.167 --> 00:09:43.708
Okay, listen, you!

00:09:43.708 --> 00:09:46.250
I'd <i>never </i>team up with
a bunch of candy-asses like that!

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:47.875
Oh, wouldn't you now?

00:09:47.875 --> 00:09:50.500
Wow, do I smell a scoop!

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:52.667
Jeez! I can't take any more of this crap.

00:09:52.667 --> 00:09:54.542
Let's go, Tatsuma.

00:10:15.375 --> 00:10:16.917
Living dead?

00:10:16.917 --> 00:10:20.917
Old man Yang used to know
a thing or two about Taoism.

00:10:20.917 --> 00:10:22.750
Yang? You mean that guy?

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:26.792
He's the head of the notorious
Three Wise Men of East Shinjuku.

00:10:26.792 --> 00:10:28.333
Is that right?

00:10:28.333 --> 00:10:30.458
Well, it's a long story,

00:10:30.458 --> 00:10:32.625
but now he's supposedly
a fine, upstanding citizen.

00:10:32.625 --> 00:10:33.750
Or so the story went.

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:35.333
--Hey, Yang!
--I heard he might have an idea

00:10:35.333 --> 00:10:37.125
--The corpses are gone!
--as to why we haven't been getting any sleep lately.

00:10:37.125 --> 00:10:40.208
--So they've come, have they?
--as to why we haven't been getting any sleep lately.

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:44.250
Wang, Fan! They're here!

00:10:59.792 --> 00:11:01.333
You gotta be kidding me!

00:11:07.792 --> 00:11:11.583
Fuku Ju Ko Mu Ryo!

00:11:11.583 --> 00:11:16.083
Damn, I ain't losing!

00:11:16.083 --> 00:11:21.125
Rin Pyo To Sha Kai Jin Retsu...

00:11:21.125 --> 00:11:22.292
...Zen!

00:11:23.917 --> 00:11:25.750
<i>Ko</i>!

00:11:28.583 --> 00:11:29.667
What the...

00:11:29.667 --> 00:11:30.958
Kyouichi!

00:11:35.292 --> 00:11:36.875
Fan! Wang!

00:11:43.167 --> 00:11:45.500
Boss!

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:47.583
This ain't good!

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:54.792
That girl...

00:11:54.792 --> 00:11:56.250
Yang!

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:57.875
Wang! Fan!

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:20.208
That was the girl.

00:12:20.208 --> 00:12:21.375
"Rest In Peace"

00:12:21.375 --> 00:12:24.750
You mean the girl who washed up here?

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:26.375
Yeah...

00:12:26.375 --> 00:12:31.750
Old man Yang said he'd give us
the full story when we caught up with him.

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:33.792
The living dead...

00:12:34.958 --> 00:12:37.542
There is a certain kind of evil
spirit known as a Fuishimon,

00:12:37.542 --> 00:12:40.042
which kills its former friends and family.

00:12:40.042 --> 00:12:43.875
If the giant demon you saw is controlling them,

00:12:43.875 --> 00:12:46.292
it may be a kind of Moryo demon.

00:12:46.292 --> 00:12:48.375
"Moryo"?

00:12:48.375 --> 00:12:50.375
Though they are spirits that
live in nature and inanimate things,

00:12:50.375 --> 00:12:53.375
it's also said that Moryo are demons,
which prey upon corpses and other spirits.

00:12:53.375 --> 00:12:55.083
So then they ended up as fodder for it?

00:12:55.083 --> 00:12:59.750
Those guys Kyouichi knew?
And that girl from Homei High School?

00:13:00.875 --> 00:13:02.292
What the hell?!

00:13:02.292 --> 00:13:05.750
We've been on the hunt every single night for
the past two weeks, and we still turned up short.

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:08.250
Things just keep on getting worse!

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:09.708
Komaki!

00:13:09.708 --> 00:13:12.750
It's because we were unable to determine
a common link among the victims.

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:15.917
Old man Yang was more helpful than you.

00:13:15.917 --> 00:13:19.250
Don't compare me to
that renegade Taoist hermit!

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:20.583
What'd you say?!

00:13:20.583 --> 00:13:24.417
Weren't you the one who said
it doesn't matter who dies?

00:13:24.417 --> 00:13:26.125
You lookin' for a fight, Doom and Gloom?!

00:13:26.125 --> 00:13:27.542
You simpleton...

00:13:27.542 --> 00:13:29.167
Cut it out, you two!

00:13:29.167 --> 00:13:32.375
Those who were devoured by
the demon are coming back to life

00:13:32.375 --> 00:13:34.250
and killing even more people.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:37.292
That's what's happening here. Right, Kisaragi?

00:13:37.292 --> 00:13:39.417
That's right.

00:13:39.417 --> 00:13:41.792
I'm sure we all feel the same.

00:13:41.792 --> 00:13:44.292
We all want to protect this city.

00:13:44.292 --> 00:13:46.333
Very impressive, Ms. Student Council President!

00:13:46.333 --> 00:13:48.042
You sure know how to talk.

00:13:48.042 --> 00:13:48.958
Houraiji!

00:13:48.958 --> 00:13:53.375
But the thing is,
anyone can make a pretty speech.

00:13:53.375 --> 00:13:56.625
What are you doing while
we bust our asses fighting?

00:13:56.625 --> 00:13:58.000
What can you do?

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:00.208
This isn't where you belong, little lady.

00:14:00.208 --> 00:14:04.667
You can talk all important-like
<i>after </i>you've done some real work.

00:14:04.667 --> 00:14:07.542
You son of a bitch! How dare you
speak that way to Lady Misato?!

00:14:07.542 --> 00:14:09.125
It's all right, Kisaragi.

00:14:09.125 --> 00:14:10.125
But!

00:14:10.125 --> 00:14:11.292
It's all right.

00:14:11.292 --> 00:14:13.042
Please continue.

00:14:13.042 --> 00:14:14.542
Yes, ma'am...

00:14:15.625 --> 00:14:18.625
Well, anyway, look at this.

00:14:18.625 --> 00:14:20.625
I compiled a list of all those reported missing,

00:14:20.625 --> 00:14:23.333
who had been on intimate
terms with any of the victims.

00:14:23.333 --> 00:14:24.458
What the heck is this?

00:14:24.458 --> 00:14:26.708
There are so many...

00:14:26.708 --> 00:14:29.167
The next one will probably be from Homei High.

00:14:29.167 --> 00:14:33.292
Still, we don't know anything
about whoever that is.

00:14:33.292 --> 00:14:34.333
Right?

00:14:34.333 --> 00:14:37.375
Yes, you're absolutely right, Sakurai!

00:14:38.708 --> 00:14:40.125
Wait a minute.

00:14:40.125 --> 00:14:42.000
Wouldn't <i>she </i>know?

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:43.708
She'd probably know even
more than she needs to!

00:14:43.708 --> 00:14:46.667
By "she" you couldn't mean...

00:14:46.667 --> 00:14:47.667
Huh?

00:14:47.667 --> 00:14:49.083
From Homei High?

00:14:49.083 --> 00:14:51.000
Oh, you mean Kugayama?

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:53.750
She was one of the best violinists in Tokyo!

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:56.542
She was originally from Hokkaido.
I heard she was living on campus.

00:14:56.542 --> 00:14:58.333
Huh? Who was she close to?

00:14:58.333 --> 00:15:00.417
Well, I'm pretty sure she had
a boyfriend named Kamiyogi.

00:15:00.417 --> 00:15:03.833
Huh? Her address? I've got that memorized!

00:15:03.833 --> 00:15:07.875
Say, why do you want to know that anyway?

00:15:07.875 --> 00:15:10.875
Uh, academic interest?

00:15:10.875 --> 00:15:11.750
Come again?

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:13.917
I mean... Someone asked me to find out.

00:15:13.917 --> 00:15:15.417
Oh? Who was that?

00:15:15.417 --> 00:15:17.708
Um, well... I'm sorry!

00:15:17.708 --> 00:15:19.875
Whoa, wait!

00:15:19.875 --> 00:15:22.625
Well, there's the mysterious
transfer student for you.

00:15:22.625 --> 00:15:24.958
So obviously suspicious...

00:15:24.958 --> 00:15:27.167
I smell a scoop!

00:15:30.542 --> 00:15:33.375
Split up? What are you talking about, Kyouichi?

00:15:33.375 --> 00:15:36.375
Don't you remember our terms:
that all five of us go together?

00:15:36.375 --> 00:15:38.083
Sheesh, you bozos.

00:15:38.083 --> 00:15:41.958
We're not kids! Plus, I never agreed
to those terms in the first place!

00:15:41.958 --> 00:15:43.375
But...

00:15:43.375 --> 00:15:46.542
Thanks to 'ole Gloom 'n Doom,
I haven't had much sleep the past two weeks.

00:15:46.542 --> 00:15:49.292
Me and Tatsuma are going our own way now.

00:15:49.292 --> 00:15:51.917
Well, I can't say I don't understand how you feel.

00:15:51.917 --> 00:15:53.958
Who do you think you are being so selfish?

00:15:53.958 --> 00:15:55.875
Quiet, she-male.

00:15:55.875 --> 00:15:57.042
What was that?!

00:15:57.042 --> 00:15:58.708
And anyhow...

00:15:58.708 --> 00:16:01.583
If we don't get our acts together and settle this,

00:16:01.583 --> 00:16:04.125
they won't get to rest in peace.

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:10.375
Houraiji, I haven't gotten your report yet.

00:16:10.375 --> 00:16:12.125
Inugami...

00:16:12.125 --> 00:16:17.750
What you do at night is your business,
but I don't plan on teaching you next year.

00:16:19.792 --> 00:16:22.167
Oh, and Hiyu...

00:16:22.167 --> 00:16:24.083
It hasn't been too safe around here lately.

00:16:24.083 --> 00:16:27.833
Don't go getting yourself
into any dangerous spots.

00:16:27.833 --> 00:16:29.000
Yes, sir.

00:16:40.958 --> 00:16:42.917
Kamiyogi...

00:16:45.042 --> 00:16:48.833
Kamiyogi... Kamiyogi...

00:16:51.208 --> 00:16:55.125
C'mon, come to me, Kamiyogi.

00:16:57.292 --> 00:16:58.875
Yuko?

00:17:01.375 --> 00:17:02.958
What are you doing here?

00:17:02.958 --> 00:17:06.417
Y'know, this is kinda weird, isn't it?

00:17:06.417 --> 00:17:08.458
I mean, you're...

00:17:08.458 --> 00:17:10.250
You already...

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:11.792
...died!

00:18:00.042 --> 00:18:02.542
Uh-oh, now I saw it!

00:18:03.917 --> 00:18:05.042
Huh?!

00:18:31.375 --> 00:18:33.208
You're not getting away! Let's go!

00:18:33.208 --> 00:18:34.500
Right!

00:18:35.333 --> 00:18:37.958
Wh-What the heck was that?!

00:18:39.458 --> 00:18:41.917
I'm sorry, Tono.

00:18:50.292 --> 00:18:51.292
It jumped.

00:18:51.292 --> 00:18:52.792
And we're gonna bring it down.

00:18:52.792 --> 00:18:53.917
Right...

00:19:06.917 --> 00:19:07.917
Her?

00:19:07.917 --> 00:19:10.000
What the heck, she's just a kid!

00:19:23.375 --> 00:19:24.750
This place is...

00:19:25.625 --> 00:19:29.917
Seems more like it's lured us
into its den than retreated to it.

00:19:29.917 --> 00:19:31.250
Let's go.

00:19:42.792 --> 00:19:44.500
Here they are.

00:20:04.667 --> 00:20:08.708
You guys, go on to Heaven for us, all right?

00:20:14.125 --> 00:20:18.500
Shikakushima, Tsurusemino, Itomoretoru,

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:22.708
Arishifuwe, Tsumihitono, Noroitoku!

00:20:26.042 --> 00:20:26.917
He returned our spell?!

00:20:26.917 --> 00:20:28.208
--What now?
--Try again!

00:20:32.875 --> 00:20:35.875
Shakuko, Shako, Kinkatsu, Kinshin!

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:47.250
You monster!

00:20:48.875 --> 00:20:50.125
Don't be rash!

00:20:51.917 --> 00:20:53.708
Now, then...

00:20:53.708 --> 00:21:00.417
Mister Eyebrows, while we're at it,
there's something I'd like to know.

00:21:01.750 --> 00:21:03.917
There's no end to them!

00:21:03.917 --> 00:21:05.042
Kyouichi!

00:21:06.542 --> 00:21:07.958
Tatsuma!

00:21:09.167 --> 00:21:12.250
Go for its arms!

00:21:28.750 --> 00:21:32.250
You goddamn renegade!

00:21:55.875 --> 00:21:58.667
The Kujakushi? What a bother...

00:21:59.833 --> 00:22:03.125
No choice then. Do it, Claire.

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:11.208
Kyouichi! Hiyu!

00:22:15.875 --> 00:22:17.667
It blew up by mistake.

00:22:17.667 --> 00:22:20.250
Cripes, what a pain!

00:22:20.250 --> 00:22:22.292
Hey, you're not going anywhere, asshole!

00:22:59.667 --> 00:23:01.833
Kyouichi...

00:23:01.833 --> 00:23:05.833
Hey! Kyouichi! Hiyu!

00:23:09.167 --> 00:23:11.708
This is...

00:23:11.708 --> 00:23:13.625
I told you.

00:23:15.125 --> 00:23:18.292
This isn't where you belong, little lady.

00:23:21.167 --> 00:23:23.167
I couldn't protect them...

00:23:25.875 --> 00:23:27.875
I couldn't protect them!

00:23:29.167 --> 00:23:31.708
I repeat: According to a police report,

00:23:31.708 --> 00:23:33.292
the corpses discovered in
the area opened by the cave-in

00:23:33.292 --> 00:23:35.417
--were just about all of the missing persons.
--...the number of recovered bodies alone

00:23:35.417 --> 00:23:37.208
is thought to number more than a hundred.

00:23:37.208 --> 00:23:40.583
Seeking to at least confirm identities,
the relatives of those missing are...

00:23:41.792 --> 00:23:43.125
Was it a dream?

00:23:45.958 --> 00:23:49.125
Huh? What the... What is this?

00:23:49.125 --> 00:23:52.708
What the heck is going on?!

